9. Regression Risks and How to Avoid Them
Security Boundry Risk: Rewriting backend authentication routes to disable Clerk token requirement. Avoided by using exact CLERK_SECRET_KEY.
Integrity Risk: Dropping the SQLAlchemy unique constraint on github_repo_id causes downstream dashboard metric bleeding and polling duplicates. Avoided by performing intelligent connection_id reassignment.
10. Exact Tests/Verification Needed After Fixing
Start Backend. View the browser console across RepoMedic UI. Verify NotificationsBell requests complete with HTTP 200 via the Network tab (verifies Fix 1).
Navigate to /overview/settings/ai. Ensure API Key setup persists without throwing Status unavailable (verifies Fix 1).
Navigate to GitHub connector, reinstall App. Wait to observe whether popup window automatically sends IPC message and closes (verifies Fix 2).
Navigate to /overview/repositories. In the "Available to Monitor" table, explicitly 'Add' any preexisting GitHub repository. Assure successful row transfer visually into "Monitored Repositories" without 500 error warnings (verifies Fix 3).
